silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_01_concrete_anchor_5#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the apex; same in both papers. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
